            \item Architected and operate JP Retail MCP, an AI analytics platform that lets retail teams query 115+ metrics, knowledge, workflows, and science model outputs through natural language; grew adoption to 301 monthly active users and 24K invocations in May 2026.

            \item Built the platform's online query path, offline ETL path, domain skill warehouse, IAM-authenticated MCP gateway, SQL validation, caller attribution, structured logs, and CloudWatch metrics for 6+ departments.

