            \item Built a reusable AWS CDK data-access platform for Spark-backed pipelines and ad-hoc analysis, standardizing Redshift, Glue, EMR, IAM, and Lake Formation provisioning; onboarded 8 teams and cut setup from weeks to 1 day.

